# Branch Prediction

Branch prediction is a feature available in Ibex that can be configured to use static prediction to improve performance during instruction fetching.

## Mechanism and Goal

When enabled (by setting the ``BranchPrediction`` parameter to 1), the predictor attempts to predict the outcome of a branch based on its offset.</data>
